            0.882,
            0.122
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ashwin created a greeting card to pay gratitude to his teacher on the day of Guru Purnima. He applied turmeric paste on white"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.125,
            0.596,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.143,
                0.125,
                0.596,
                0.307
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_9_image_2.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.222,
            0.588,
            0.291
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I respect my teacher as she nurtured curiosity within me and bestowed upon me the gift of learning. I bow my head in gratitude to her!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.605,
            0.122,
            0.882,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "paper and dried it. He wrote his wishes in the teacher's mother tongue (Odia language) on the dried paper using one of the solutions tested in Table  2.4. Which solution can be used to write the message? His teacher applauded his creative use of this concept."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.355,
            0.322,
            0.506,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.355,
                0.322,
                0.506,
                0.454
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_9_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.515,
            0.373,
            0.755,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Are there any substances whose odours change on adding acidic or basic substances?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.467,
            0.882,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There are some substances whose odours change in an acidic or basic medium. These are called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "olfactory indicators",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". Let us explore more!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.543,
            0.576,
            0.563
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 2.6: Let us investigate"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.577,
            0.883,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take some finely chopped onions in a container, along with some strips of clean cotton cloth or filter paper."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.62,
            0.781,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Tightly close the container and leave it overnight."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.644,
            0.883,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take two of the cotton cloth or filter paper strips from the container and check their odour."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.687,
            0.884,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Keep them on a clean surface and put a few drops of tamarind water on one strip and a few drops of baking soda solution on the other. Allow the drops to spread on the strips."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.266,
            0.747,
            0.524,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Check the odour again."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.772,
            0.883,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you notice any change in the odour of the onion strips before and after putting tamarind water and baking soda solution on them?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.833,
            0.534,
            0.852
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note your observations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.856,
            0.883,
            0.895
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Similarly, test the change in the odour with other acidic and basic substances and record your observations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.015,
            0.919,
            0.27,
            0.984
          ],
